    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Status Card",
    "Usage",
    "Compact card that reports the status of one thing — a device, service or job — with a feedback-coloured indicator, title and value. Status is conveyed by icon + label, not colour alone.",
    "Anatomy",
    "Top-level layers of the first variant: Title · Trend. Instances keep their SOLAR component names.",
    "Specification",
    "16 variants.\n• status — success | neutral | danger | warning\n• state — default | hover | disabled\n• ghost — false | true",
    "Related",
    "For KPI numbers use Stat Card; for an actionable alert use Insight Card.",
    "Accessibility",
    "Not yet documented here — follow the state-class requirements in CLAUDE.md §7 Check 2 and the WCAG AA rules in §6."
